  "executive_briefing": "The mid-2026 digital asset ecosystem is undergoing a profound structural realignment. The US Senate's placement of the Digital Asset Market CLARITY Act (H.R.3633) on its legislative calendar represents a historic step toward establishing native, compliant smart contract layers directly on Bitcoin, posing a formidable challenge to the EVM hegemony. While institutional Bitcoin demand continues to mature through diversified financial instruments like the newly proposed Bitcoin Bond ETF and resilient spot ETF flows, Ethereum faces continued narrative fatigue and treasury pressure as ETH prices contract into the mid-$1,500s. To bridge these shifting capital pools, the DeFi landscape is permanently phasing out vulnerable wrapped bridges in favor of direct, non-custodial cross-chain swap solutions like THORChain, deBridge, and Symbiosis, maintaining decentralized liquidity routing across isolated layer-1 networks.",
